<title>USA: Infoseek says names Wright as CFO.</title>
<headline>Infoseek says names Wright as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infoseek Corp said on Tuesday it named Les Wright as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wright was formerly chief financial officer and chief operating officer for Fractal Design Corp.</p>
<p>Infoseek, based in Sunnyvale, California, provides Internet navigational services primarily through &quot;Infoseek Guide&quot; which is a free service aimed at individual users.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to discuss who Wright succeeded as CFO.</p>
